      en: ["The lake was created in 1924 by the Assam Bengal Railway.", "Named after Mr. Foy, a prominent British railway engineer.", "The park was extensively redeveloped by Concord Group in 2004.", "Features a dedicated water park known as Sea World.", "Located in the scenic Pahartali hills of Chittagong.", "Serves as a combination of theme park, water park, and resort."],
